msgid "Directory Services Recovery"
msgstr "目录服务恢复"

#: src/lib/components/custom/DirectoryServices/Recovery.svelte
msgid ""
"Sylve temporarily stops running Samba and Winbind services to keep recovery "
"state consistent. SMB clients will be disconnected. After completion or a "
"safe rollback, only previously running services are resumed. Incomplete "
"recovery leaves them stopped."
msgstr ""
"Sylve 会暂时停止运行 Samba 和 Winbind 服务，以保持恢复状态一致。SMB 客户端将"
"断开连接。恢复完成或安全回滚后，只有此前正在运行的服务会恢复运行。恢复未完成"
"时，这些服务将保持停止。"

#: src/lib/components/custom/DirectoryServices/Recovery.svelte
msgid ""
"An interrupted restore is pending. Enter the passphrase used for that "
"restore to return to the protected previous state."
msgstr ""
"一次中断的恢复尚待处理。请输入该恢复所用的密码，以返回此前受保护的状态。"

#: src/lib/components/custom/DirectoryServices/Recovery.svelte
msgid ""
"The encrypted bundle includes machine-trust secrets, ID-allocation "
"databases, Kerberos credentials, the encryption key and a Sylve database "
"snapshot. It does not back up share data or the domain controller."
msgstr ""
"加密包包含计算机信任密钥、ID 分配数据库、Kerberos 凭据、加密密钥以及 Sylve 数"
"据库快照。它不会备份共享数据或域控制器。"

#: src/lib/components/custom/DirectoryServices/Recovery.svelte
msgid ""
"Restore requires the same node and saved configuration, plus a reachable "
"domain controller to verify the saved trust. It does not rejoin the domain, "
"replace unrelated Sylve settings, edit shares or change filesystem ACLs. "
"Older credentials or changed share identities are rejected. Existing ID "
"allocations and the Samba version must match the snapshot. Transient Samba "
"caches are cleared."
msgstr ""
"恢复需要相同的节点和已保存配置，以及可访问的域控制器来验证已保存的信任关系。"
"此操作不会重新加入域、替换无关的 Sylve 设置、编辑共享或更改文件系统 ACL。较旧"
"的凭据或已更改的共享标识会被拒绝。现有 ID 分配和 Samba 版本必须与快照一致。临"
"时 Samba 缓存会被清除。"

